# LAN terminals (#396, ARCHITECTURE.md "LAN terminals (#402)"):
# GroceryPOS-ProxyLan, its own Caddy process beside GroceryPOS-Proxy, so a
# missing LAN address fails only this service (SCM keeps retrying it) and
# https://localhost:1443 keeps working. Installed only with a LAN IP.
#
# Environment (set by the service definition):
#   GPOS_CLIENT_ROOT  the compiled client of this release
#   GPOS_LAN_IP       the fixed private IPv4 address (installer -LanIp)
import app.caddy

https://{$GPOS_LAN_IP}:1443 {
	# The LAN IP only: never a wildcard, never loopback. A request here that
	# names another Host (e.g. localhost:1443) matches no site and is never
	# proxied.
	bind {$GPOS_LAN_IP}
	import gpos_app
	# Never health from the LAN (#394): a 404, not proxied to the API.
	handle /v1/health* {
		respond 404
	}
}
